WEBVTT

00:59:29.167 --> 00:59:31.809
The disclosure of the leader
and the people who can say,

00:59:31.833 --> 00:59:34.024
"I don't know, I want to try
and ask for help."

00:59:34.048 --> 00:59:39.059
But this asking for help in some people
and in some cultures means,

00:59:39.083 --> 00:59:41.809
"I don't know and I'm going
to find out who can help me."

00:59:41.833 --> 00:59:43.309
Like I said, who can help me?

00:59:43.333 --> 00:59:45.559
I don't experience it
as a weakness whatsoever.

00:59:45.583 --> 00:59:46.893
I have no shame about it,

00:59:46.917 --> 00:59:48.476
but I know that for other people

00:59:48.500 --> 00:59:51.809
it's an admittance
of what's wrong with me.

00:59:51.833 --> 00:59:53.851
And the moment it's what's wrong with you,

00:59:53.875 --> 00:59:55.393
I can't do it.

00:59:55.417 --> 00:59:58.143
Then your asking for help
is a completely different thing.

00:59:58.167 --> 01:00:01.059
And you put these people to work together?